Art. 63 Transitional provisions
1 For the granting of funding for overheads by Innosuisse and for the details of the calculation of funding contributions, the Ordinance of 10 June 1985 on the Promotion of Research and Innovation, and Article 10s paragraphs 6 and 7 with annex and the corresponding transitional provisions of 24 November 2010, shall apply until the provisions on funding and federal funding contributions under Chapters 7 and 8 HEdA come into force, but no later than 31 December 2016.
2 Until Chapters 1–5 HEdA come into force, Article 52 paragraph 2 second sentence has the following wording:
...
