:INFO
Art. 64 Commencement
1 This Ordinance comes into force, subject to paragraphs 2 and 3, on 1 January 2014.
2 Article 55 paragraph 3 shall come into force at the same time as Chapters 1–5 HEdA.
3 Articles 37 and 38 shall come into force at the same time as the provisions on funding and federal funding contributions under Chapters 7 and 8 HEdA, but not later than 1 January 2017.
|

